{"data":[{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-08T15:12:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1755610482793382251"],"id":"1755610482793382251","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":27599,"like_count":308,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":6},"text":"你最近被器大活好的前任骚扰了。\n说实话，有点儿心动。\n毕竟器大活好是实打实能感受到的。\n只是你一想到分手是他甩的你，那股子犟劲儿就上来了，爱搭不理的吊着他，自己该怎么玩怎么玩。\n他倒是一直一副乖巧小媳妇的样子跟在你身边。\n大有你不答应就不罢休的架势。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1755610482793382251"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-07T16:40:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1755270319160594609"],"id":"1755270319160594609","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":52372,"like_count":212,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":1},"text":"你是一个好奇心和行动力都很强的人。\n某天，你在网上看到了有人分享了户外野战的经历。\n你突然想到，你和家里的老古董还没试过呢。\n于是趁着夏夜，兴冲冲地拉着他，开车到了你做了很久攻略的山沟。\n四下无人，蝉鸣重重叠叠。\n你俩没忍住，先在车上做了一次。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1755270319160594609"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-07T14:33:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1755238288670249387"],"id":"1755238288670249387","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":49821,"like_count":232,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":4},"text":"（臭打球的2.0）\n他打球伤了膝盖。\n你听到消息赶到医务室的时候，他正和队友插科打诨，好像队医不是在给他的伤口消毒一样。\n你走到人身后，他才后知后觉。\n转过头就是一副瘪着嘴的委屈样子，恨不得眼里包上泪。\n你又气又疼，干脆一巴掌拍到他的脑袋上。\n收着劲儿，连闷响都没有。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1755238288670249387"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-05T08:32:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1754422634056679594"],"id":"1754422634056679594","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":138,"impression_count":400569,"like_count":1938,"quote_count":12,"reply_count":65,"retweet_count":45},"text":"有人说，在床上叫对方的职业会很色情。\n于是，在某次性爱的时候，你搂住身上人的脖子，逼他停下动作和你对视。\n你眼里夹了点儿爽出来的泪，微喘着粗气，叫他：\n臭打球的。\n他愣怔了一瞬，随即笑着吻了吻你的唇。\n是我干你干的不够爽了？你还敢这样激我。\n#一爱","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1754422634056679594"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-05T08:10:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1754417190324125965"],"id":"1754417190324125965","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":32000,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1754386984670495053","type":"quoted"}],"text":"诚邀大家再来吃点儿细糠🫰 https://t.co/07LeSmJou7","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1754417190324125965"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-05T04:02:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1754354740006425049"],"id":"1754354740006425049","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":32538,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1754266679922856018","type":"quoted"}],"text":"在听我的版本之前\n先吃点儿好饭吧家人们🫰 https://t.co/R9TDTypM7w","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1754354740006425049"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-04T08:33:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1754060666338787829"],"id":"1754060666338787829","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":33549,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1753699672940855650","type":"quoted"}],"text":"再帮大家重温一遍皎月🥺\n妈滴 \n我真的要一边听一边哭了🥲 https://t.co/UXMAqDPDTn","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1754060666338787829"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-03T16:53:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1753824071404724715"],"id":"1753824071404724715","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":53,"impression_count":180861,"like_count":768,"quote_count":10,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":22},"text":"你们两个的日常除了斗嘴，还是斗嘴。\n你热衷于故意惹他生气，他也热衷于把你气得鼓着腮帮子。\n不止在床下，床上也是。\n他会在你正爽的时候，突然咬你一下，或者朝你脖子吹气。\n你也会在他射精之后，喘着粗气，累得抬不起手，也要故意说他阳痿，活不好。\n#一爱","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1753824071404724715"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-03T15:26:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1753802263766966458"],"id":"1753802263766966458","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":123271,"like_count":581,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":17},"text":"你身边的朋友都说你都被他宠坏了。\n你一边反驳，一边扬扬下巴，让他帮你擦下巴上沾上的油。\n然后把嘴里的青菜嚼得咯吱作响，控诉他的缺点。\n但在你朋友看来，都是在秀恩爱。\n晚上回了家，他把你的手用领带捆住，绑在床头。\n咬你耳朵问你，我哪里做得不够好了？小狗不就是喜欢这样吗？\n#一爱","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1753802263766966458"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-03T15:08:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1753797695385612531"],"id":"1753797695385612531","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":40106,"like_count":42,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"射老师在线吗\n在线的话我就先不写了\n等他不在的时候再写🫰","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1753797695385612531"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-03T13:44:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1753776544718479763"],"id":"1753776544718479763","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":44,"impression_count":129893,"like_count":486,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":7},"text":"你把人惹生气了。\n他生的腿长，一个人提着所有东西大步走在前面。\n你脸皮薄，也不好意思在外面大声叫他，只气喘吁吁地跟在他后面。\n你本来还有点内疚，就这样小跑着跟到了家，累坏了，反而板起了脸，恼他生你的气。\n他给你按着电梯门你都撇开头去等下一趟。\n#一爱","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1753776544718479763"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-03T03:49:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1753626786506879320"],"id":"1753626786506879320","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":62989,"like_count":232,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":3},"text":"（双性孕夫2.0）\n他怀孕的时候，每天要问你很多次：他和孩子你会更喜欢谁。还要逼着你说更喜欢他。\n但是孩子真的生出来之后，反而是他把孩子看的比你重要。\n你给孩子喂奶粉他都得在边上监工，生怕冷了热了的。\n你学着他的样子和孩子争风吃醋，他连个眼神都不给你。\n#四爱","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1753626786506879320"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-03T03:00:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1753614382108709329"],"id":"1753614382108709329","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":39,"impression_count":136947,"like_count":584,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":10},"text":"（双性孕夫 注意避雷）\n你的小狗怀孕两个月了，他自己就一副瘦弱的样子，于是这两个月你只陪他在家里，也不敢碰他。\n今天他在家里又哭又闹，质问你是不是不爱他了，所以不让他出门。\n你才没办法，带着他来商场逛一圈。\n恰巧你在商场也碰到了一个身形和他差不多的孕夫，只是肚子看起来要有七八个月了。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1753614382108709329"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-02T16:16:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1753452318421660018"],"id":"1753452318421660018","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":18,"impression_count":66525,"like_count":291,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":6},"text":"难得的周末闲暇时光，你们两个拿出了拼了一半的乐高。\n分工明确，你负责看说明书，找零件，他负责拼接工作。\n后来你找累了，只负责看说明书。\n再后来你趴在他背上，看他一个人拼。\n但是你又觉得有点无聊，他拼好一截儿，你就顺手拆一截儿。\n他只好脾气地揉揉你的头发，也不阻拦你。\n#一爱","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1753452318421660018"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-02T10:04:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1753358599966085199"],"id":"1753358599966085199","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":54,"impression_count":196195,"like_count":814,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":11},"text":"你因为发烧在家休息了几天。\n这天你感觉精神好多了，自己在家闲的无聊，决定骚扰他。\n“哥哥你看，衣服脱光了一点儿都不冷。”\n然后是一张上半身裸照，你还握住了一边的奶子。\n“想哥哥的几把了，哥哥帮我看看小穴是不是流水了。”\n然后是一张m腿的对镜自拍。\n#一爱","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1753358599966085199"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-02T09:36:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1753351760197128362"],"id":"1753351760197128362","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":157070,"like_count":285,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你刚刚开会的时候发了好大一通脾气。\n坐在办公室里生气的时候，收到了他的短信，说在水吧里等你。\n你想到他那副样子就生气，但还是很诚实地去了。\n你刚关上门，他就在身后把你抱住，还伸手落了锁。\n他在你耳边絮絮地给你道歉，说是他没管好手下的人惹你生气了。\n回家好好补偿你。\n#一爱","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1753351760197128362"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-02T09:22:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1753348093616308494"],"id":"1753348093616308494","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":113896,"like_count":464,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":9},"text":"你没想到，随便一个艳遇对象竟然是你新来的大学老师。\n所以你在看到他第一眼的时候，就开始无比后悔自己的口无遮拦。\n你本来想下了课偷偷溜走，却被他精准地叫住了名字。\n你跟着他回办公室的路上，一直在思考该怎么办。\n他像个没事人一样，只和你闲聊，丝毫不顾你的忐忑。\n#一爱","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1753348093616308494"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-02T09:07:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1753344253932249582"],"id":"1753344253932249582","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":51934,"like_count":178,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你是他养在娱乐圈里的金丝雀。\n不算多火，但生的白白嫩嫩的，活脱脱的清纯小白花。\n他有时候闲下来也会去你的录制现场探班，但没人知道你们的关系。\n这天，你正在参加一个访谈类的节目，衣着、活动都是中规中矩的类型。\n你正按部就班地回答问题，就看他不知道什么时候站到了摄像机后。\n#一爱","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1753344253932249582"}],"errors":[{"detail":"Sorry, you are not authorized to see the Tweet with referenced_tweets.id: [1754386984670495053].","parameter":"referenced_tweets.id","resource_id":"1754386984670495053","resource_type":"tweet","section":"includes","title":"Authorization Error","type":"https://api.x.com/2/problems/not-authorized-for-resource","value":"1754386984670495053"},{"detail":"Sorry, you are not authorized to see the Tweet with referenced_tweets.id: [1754266679922856018].","parameter":"referenced_tweets.id","resource_id":"1754266679922856018","resource_type":"tweet","section":"includes","title":"Authorization Error","type":"https://api.x.com/2/problems/not-authorized-for-resource","value":"1754266679922856018"},{"detail":"Could not find tweet with referenced_tweets.id: [1753699672940855650].","parameter":"referenced_tweets.id","resource_id":"1753699672940855650","resource_type":"tweet","title":"Not Found Error","type":"https://api.x.com/2/problems/resource-not-found","value":"1753699672940855650"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1229453490537107457","name":"人间杀爸客（不放授权版","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950068769885462528/Z5noQeeo_normal.jpg","username":"HnrBB2nai","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"1755610482793382251","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3fr5qe1ao7gcm1ld0y6bfik0g09subh","oldest_id":"1753344253932249582","result_count":18}}